KINGrinder's K series has a reputation for giving you a lot of grinder for the money. The K5 is a full-size hand grinder with the adjustment on the outside, so you can change the grind setting without taking it apart.

A good middle ground if you want something better than an entry-level grinder without paying 1Zpresso prices. Read more in [my hand grinder post](/coffee/reviews/hand-coffee-grinders).
